******** Mesh parameters *********
nx              8    // mesh points in x-direction
ny              12    // mesh points in y-direction
nz              12    // mesh points in z-direction

Lx            1.0    // domain size in x-direction
Ly            1.0    // domain size in y-direction
Lz            1.0    // domain size in z-direction

clusterY      2.0    // mesh clustering in y-direction
clusterZ      2.0    // mesh clustering in z-direction

******** Timestepping parameters ********
t_final       0.25    // final time-step
dt            0.05    // time-step
vis_steps       1    // visualisation step frequency

******** Dimensionless parameters ********
Re            10.0    // Reynolds number
Ha	          10.0    // Hartmann number, dependent on half width of channel = 1.
